Antibody Texture Morphology - License and Usage Notice
==========================================================

1. Scope
--------
This repository does not contain original code written by Alexandre
Matov. All MATLAB code here -- the `SLIC/` folder in its entirety, and
the following root-level driver scripts -- is from the SLIC
(Subcellular Location Image Classifier) toolbox, developed by the
laboratory of Robert F. Murphy, PhD, at the Center for Bioimage
Informatics, Carnegie Mellon University:

  Boland, M.V., Murphy, R.F. "A Neural Network Classifier Capable of
  Recognizing the Patterns of All Major Subcellular Structures in
  Fluorescence Microscope Images of HeLa Cells." Bioinformatics 17.12
  (2001): 1213-1223.

The following root-level scripts are Murphy Lab templates in which
Alexandre Matov substituted file paths to point to his own gastric
cancer immunofluorescence image dataset -- no other changes were made
to their logic:

  createproc_GC_AZ521.m, createproc_GC_HS746T.m, createproc_GC_MKN45.m,
  createproc_GC_MKN7.m, createproc_GC_SCH.m, createproc_GC_SNU1.m,
  createproc_GC_TMK1.m, handseg_GC_AZ521.m, handseg_GC_HS746T.m,
  handseg_GC_MKN45.m, handseg_GC_MKN7.m, handseg_GC_SCH.m,
  handseg_GC_SNU1.m, handseg_GC_TMK1.m, handseg.m,
  feat_combine_auto.m, feat_lowcommon.m, feat_lowcommon_field.m,
  TTest_Features.m, TTest_FeaturesPAPER.m, Runner_0703_2013.m,
  SC_CellLevelFeatures_Wrapper.m

`ContrastStretchNorm.m` is separately authored by Sergei Koptenko,
Resonant Medical, Montreal, QC (March 2006), and is not covered by
this notice either.

2. What is Alexandre Matov's own work
---------------------------------------
Alexandre Matov's own contribution in this repository consists of
running the above (third-party) code against his own gastric cancer
dataset and the resulting output: the T-Test result files (`.txt`/
`.xls`) in `results/`, and the PDF reports in `reports/`.

